{"page":20160,"part":1,"text":"　　 第二 血法\n\n　　 蹲 七分三折，管直心圆。\n\n　　 驻 七分力到水聚。\n\n　　 提 三分大指下节骨竦水下。\n\n　　 捺 九分力满。\n\n　　 过 十分疾过。\n\n　　 抢 各有分数，圆蹲直抢，偏蹲侧抢，出锋空抢。\n\n　　 衄 三分三摇笔杀力。\n\n　　 字生于墨，墨生于水，水者字之血也。笔尖受水，一点已枯矣。 水墨皆藏于副毫之内，蹲之则水下，驻之则水聚，提之则水皆入纸 矣。捺以匀之，枪以杀之、补之，衄以圆之。过贵乎疾，如飞鸟惊 蛇，力到自然，不可少凝滞，仍不得重改。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20160,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"058f8f3b8cfd9e94a056e4540d1bc80f14dc8eb21680b0b3d15bd7f493dc5e09","textSha256":"058f8f3b8cfd9e94a056e4540d1bc80f14dc8eb21680b0b3d15bd7f493dc5e09","fileSha256":"058f8f3b8cfd9e94a056e4540d1bc80f14dc8eb21680b0b3d15bd7f493dc5e09","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20160-work-127.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"翰林要诀 · 第二  血法","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/4JuVN7mkqoqQ3sCHF1StYc","originalPages":[494],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":8,"sourceTextSha256":"cfa8c6c749ee151b430c8343872109f15f02a9c2294063e010d9e8c538d56e7f","id":"word-翰林要诀-22","page_id":"attachment:翰林要诀.docx","work":"翰林要诀","author":"陈绎曾","type":"text","chapterHint":"血法","root_id":"4JuVN7mkqoqQ3sCHF1StYc","origin":"wolai-word","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":8},{"start":10,"end":25,"sourceTextSha256":"6789efa3b79dfaa60e2ca99ee53ea85931ce413bb5467ce6f34b0d51010e4822","id":"word-翰林要诀-23","page_id":"attachment:翰林要诀.docx","work":"翰林要诀","author":"陈绎曾","type":"text","chapterHint":"血法","root_id":"4JuVN7mkqoqQ3sCHF1StYc","origin":"wolai-word","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":15},{"start":27,"end":39,"sourceTextSha256":"929409f9868929866e816f401dab1d8ab71963aba878accf5cc8123ecf3f52c7","id":"word-翰林要诀-24","page_id":"attachment:翰林要诀.docx","work":"翰林要诀","author":"陈绎曾","type":"text","chapterHint":"血法","root_id":"4JuVN7mkqoqQ3sCHF1StYc","origin":"wolai-word","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":12},{"start":41,"end":57,"sourceTextSha256":"2710f111e5f62faf4cc